This repository (source code, documentation, data, tests, and all other
content — the "Work") is the private, copyrighted work of the author.
NOTARIUS is a research prototype for semantic tracing and tamper-localization
of information (provenance of a data element: where it came from, what
happened to it, native vs inserted, and what exactly changed).

